#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/factory-gauge.adoc:262
#, no-wrap
msgid "Promise Limits"
msgstr "承诺与待处理请求限制"

#. type: #promise
#: ../src/factory-gauge.adoc:265
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Each time a factory gauge requests a set of ingredients to be sent to its "
#| "destination address, a promise is created (also referred to as a pending "
#| "request). Each promise records the number of expected to be produced, but "
#| "have yet to arrive in storage. When accounting for the number of "
#| "monitored items in storage, the number of items recorded in promises is "
#| "added to the actual storage amount before being compared to the target "
#| "amount. Doing so stops the factory gauge from excessively sending "
#| "ingredients before the outputs of previous requests arrive."
msgid ""
"Each time a factory gauge makes a <<term-request,request>>, a [#term-"
"promise]_promise_ is created (also referred to as a [#term-pending-"
"request]_pending request_). Each promise records the number of outputs "
"expected to be produced, but have yet to arrive in storage. Before comparing "
"the <<term-storage-amount,storage amount>> with the target amount, the "
"number of items recorded in promises is added to the actual storage amount. "
"Doing so stops the factory gauge from excessively sending ingredients before "
"the outputs of previous requests arrive."
msgstr ""
"工厂仪表每次请求把一批原材料发往目标地址时，都会创建一项“承诺”，也称为待处理"
"请求。每项承诺会记录预计生产但尚未进入库存的产物数量。仪表在比较库存和目标数"
"量时，会先把承诺中记录的数量加到实际库存中。这样可以避免上一批产物尚未返回"
"时，仪表继续过量发送原材料。"

